      "rows": [
        [
          "Ordinary\n    Shares Offered by Us",
          "",
          "Up\n    to $8,500,000 of Ordinary Shares."
        ],
        [
          "Ordinary\n    Shares to be Outstanding after this Offering",
          "",
          "Up\n    to 14,042,575 Ordinary Shares may be outstanding following consummation of this offering, assuming the sale of 2,328,767 Ordinary\n    Shares, based on the assumed public offering price of $3.65"
        ],
        [
          "Plan\n    of Distribution",
          "",
          "The\n    Sales Agent may, according to the terms of the Sales Agreement, sell the Ordinary Shares offered under this prospectus supplement\n    in an \u201cat-the-market\u201d offering as defined in Rule 415(a)(4"
        ],
        [
          "Use\n    of Proceeds",
          "",
          "We\n    intend to use the net proceeds from this offering for ongoing clinical development of NS002 for anaphylaxis treatment, the initiation\n    of clinical studies for other products in our pipeline "
